Functioning Challenge (Disability)
A total of 113,595 persons aged 3 and above were reported to have at least one functioning
challenge. The number equates to a rate of 13.7% which is close to the International benchmark
of 15%. The percentage was highest in Rotuma with 21.7% followed by Lau at 18.2% with the
province of Nadroga/Navosa recording the lowest rate of 10.4%. Further details are presented
in Table 10 that follows;
